# Paper 3: the sandboxed replay's full logs are large and regenerable; their
# hashes and the short extracts (axioms.txt, versions, the last 200 lines)
# are committed by item 01.
replay/logs/*.log
replay/logs/*.jsonl
replay/logs/*.export
replay/logs/*.out
# LaTeX build products (main.pdf is committed, as paper 1's is)
latex/*.aux
latex/*.bbl
latex/*.blg
latex/*.fdb_latexmk
latex/*.fls
latex/*.log
# ... except the DOI check's run of record, which the paper cites (item 11: the
# rule above had hidden item 10's file from `git add -A`)
!latex/doi_check.log
latex/*.out
latex/*.toc
latex/*.synctex.gz
